            <ArticleTitle>Improved technique for pleural drain insertion during cardiovascular surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>503-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe an improved technique for pleural drain insertion during cardiovascular procedures performed through a median sternotomy. Benefits of this technique include less patient discomfort, optimal drain geometry, and reduced risk of pneumothorax on drain removal.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
